flowchart TD
    N1[Freeze pack schema claims rule and fail-closed policy] --> N2A[Build sealed pack for item 1]
    N1 --> N2B[Build sealed pack for item 2]
    N1 --> N2C[Build sealed pack for item N]
    N2A --> V1A[Adversarially fact-check pack 1 claims]
    N2B --> V1B[Adversarially fact-check pack 2 claims]
    N2C --> V1C[Adversarially fact-check pack N claims]
    V1A --> G1{Root gate maps missing checks to UNVERIFIABLE}
    V1B --> G1
    V1C --> G1
    G1 --> T1[Return packs artifact cards and coverage summary]
